5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf peacefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A charming sentiment, Minato. Though I suspect ""peacefully"" might be a bit optimistic given our current circumstances.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us approach this with open hearts and clear minds. We shall find the truth together.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, look at all you serious faces! Let's keep it lively, shall we? I'm sure this will be a delightful little game.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop talking about ""games"" and ""virtues."" We just need to find the wolf and get rid of it. I'm ready.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you seem very determined. Is that how you always solve problems?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Now, now, let's not start the accusations so early. It's far too soon for such tedious drama.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Energy is a gift, Takumi. If you can channel that determination into wisdom, you will be an asset to us all.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,I like the fire in Takumi! It's much more entertaining than Benjamin's boredom.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being ""determined,"" I'm being realistic. We're in danger, so we should act fast.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I wonder how the Seer feels right now. It must be a big responsibility to know the truth.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. A heavy burden, though perhaps a welcome one if it allows us to avoid unnecessary mistakes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,Truth is like a river; it eventually finds its way to the sea. We must simply learn to listen to its flow.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"You're so poetic, Servas! It's almost a crime. I might have to keep you around just for the quotes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Enough with the poetry! Does anyone actually have a plan, or are we just chatting until someone dies?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't have a plan, but I'll try my best to help everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"My plan is to observe and think. Logic usually prevails over haste, wouldn't you agree, Takumi?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us embrace the silence of the coming night. It is in the stillness that we often find the most clarity.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,I'm just going to enjoy the show. I'll be watching all of you very closely!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Fine. I'll be watching you too. I won't let the wolf win.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
