31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well... even if it was a scary night.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A lovely morning indeed. I feel quite refreshed and, more importantly, slightly more informed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The sun rises to bring us a new beginning. Let us greet this day with hope and kindness.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Morning, everyone! Who's feeling nervous? I can practically smell the tension in the air. It's delicious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Cut the act, May. Benjamin, you said you're ""informed."" Are you the Seer? Speak up.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, are you the Seer? If you are, maybe you can tell us something to help?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, your eagerness is almost endearing. However, revealing everything at once is rarely the most elegant strategy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often speaks in whispers, not shouts. Let us give Benjamin the space to decide how to share his knowledge.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, a secret! I love secrets. Come on, Ben, give us a little hint. Just a tiny one?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm tired of the riddles. If you're the Seer and you're hiding it, you're just making it easier for the wolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,I don't like it when people argue. Can't we just talk nicely?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, I can assure you that I am working toward the village's victory. For now, I know that Takumi is human.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,A wonderful revelation. It brings a sense of peace to know that we have a trusted ally among us.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"Aww, Takumi is a good boy! Now that we've cleared him, who's the real villain here?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need you to ""clear"" me! But thanks, I guess. Now, who did you check before me, or was I the first?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm glad Takumi is human. Now I feel a little safer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"You were my first choice, Takumi. I prefer to start with the most... vocal participants to stabilize the group.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a wise choice. By securing the foundation, the rest of the structure becomes easier to examine.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm starting to think Servas is too perfect. It's almost suspicious, don't you think?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,May has a point. Servas is acting like a saint. That's usually a cover for something.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
