64,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh no... Servas is gone, and Benjamin is gone too. This is so sad.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,May,,"Wow, what a twist! Poor Benjamin. I guess the wolf didn't like his ""elegant"" strategies after all.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Dammit! We killed a human and the wolf got the Seer. We're in a terrible spot now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, @Takumi... there are only three of us left. I'm scared.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,May,,"Don't be scared, Minato! Just look at me. I'm still here, and I'm still fabulous.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Shut up, May. If Benjamin was the Seer and he's dead, we have no way to know who the wolf is.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Minato,,Maybe we can still figure it out if we think carefully?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,May,,I think Takumi is being way too aggressive again. It's almost like he's trying to force us to vote for me.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm aggressive because we're losing! You're the one acting like this is a game. That's a huge red flag.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't want to vote for anyone... but we have to, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,May,,I'll vote for Takumi. He's just too loud to be a simple villager.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm a villager, you idiot! You're the wolf, and you're trying to trick Minato. I'm voting for you.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
